        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Solicitation for overtime will be directed to all CSRs which includes the Customer Service Unit and the Grand Rapids call center. If there are too few, or too many volunteers for the overtime work, overtime distribution will be proportionate to staffing between Detroit and Grand Rapids call centers. The company agrees to use the ratio of 60% Detroit and 40% Grand Rapids for overtime.",
